<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;background:#fff;line-height:1.6}
a{color:#0b5fff}
header{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 8px}
h1{font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:10px}
.sub{font-size:17px;color:#444;max-width:720px}
.cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;background:#111;color:#fff;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.note{max-width:1080px;margin:14px auto 0;padding:0 20px;font-size:13px;color:#666}
.grid{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
.card video{width:100%;display:block;background:#000;aspect-ratio:9/16;max-height:420px}
.card-body{padding:14px}
.card h2{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:6px}
.card p{font-size:14px;color:#444;margin-bottom:10px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#0b5fff;color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
footer{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;font-size:13px;color:#666;border-top:1px solid #eee}
@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:26px}.card video{max-height:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>6 Outfit Ideas for Every Occasion</h1>
<p class="sub">Street, office, date, sports, boho and winter — six quick outfit concepts to get you started. Watch, pick your vibe, then shop similar looks.</p>
<a class="cta" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=outfit+ideas+women&tag=haowordstudio-20">Shop Similar on Amazon</a>
</header>
<p class="note">Concept videos: these are AI-generated outfit concepts (model 05), not real try-ons. Affiliate disclosure: As an Amazon Associate, HaoWordTool earns from qualifying purchases.</p>
